>> a := Rige ← Objekt ; Ja ; Nee ; Boolean ; 1 ; Getal ; ['Str'] ; Tekst ; { ['Leech']. }.
Utfier skriuwe: (a telle), nije-rigel.
{ :i
	Utfier skriuwe: 
	['a '] + 
	((a ? i) type) +
	([' \‘this\’ '] this: (a ? i))  +
	[' is '] +
	(((a ? i) Neat?) of: [''] of: ['NET']) + 
	[' Neat.'],
	nije-rigel.
} × (a telle).
Utfier skriuwe: ['mar.. Neat is.. '] + ((Neat Neat?) of: ['wis NEAT!'] of: ['net NEAT??']), nije-rigel.